This directory contains the building infrastructure for MPARM toolchain
and operating systems.  The building process should be completely
automatic using these scripts:

download.sh
	Downloads source files from their distribution sites.

extract.sh
	Extracts a given source file (all source files by default).

debgen.sh
	Builds unsigned Debian packages from extracted sources.

Subdirectories binutils/ gcc/ and rtems/ contain the Debian packaging
information.

Please, note that building gcc requires previous installation of binutils
and building rtems requires previous installation of both, gcc and binutils.
Therefore you need root privileges to compile the whole toolchain. If you
want to complete the building process as a user take a look at UML (User
Mode Linux).

